@startuml
title Dragon Scroll Mark Component
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

component "DragonScrollMark.tsx" as Component
component "dragonCurve.ts" as Geometry
component "dragon-scroll-mark.css" as Styles
component "tests/dragon-scroll-mark.test.mjs" as Tests
component "HomePage" as HomePage
component "Media query state" as MediaQuery
component "requestAnimationFrame" as AnimationFrame
component "Bounded SVG viewBox" as ViewBox

HomePage --> Component : renders decorative mark
HomePage --> Component : finishSectionId
Component --> Geometry : generates curve segments
Component --> MediaQuery : desktop and reduced-motion guards
Component --> AnimationFrame : coalesces scroll updates
Component --> ViewBox : expands clipped coordinate frame
Component --> Styles : clipped desktop frame
Tests --> Geometry : verifies segment counts
Tests --> Component : verifies accessibility contract

note right of Component
The mark is decorative and aria-hidden.
It is hidden on mobile and static for
reduced-motion users.
end note

@enduml
